    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspiring ballads is an RPG set in an open fantasy world. Get reliable equipment, create powerful magic, pick up a sword and decide your fate and the fate of the inhabitants of the entire island! Become the new ballad hero!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classless system. Choose who you want to be: a brutal warrior, a destructive magician, a mobile fighter, a master of poisoning - or find an even more effective way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several schools of magic, including hidden ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create equipment from trophies from enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of types of opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants of the island, who were just waiting for you to solve their problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opportunity to win over representatives of the opposite sex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several endings - from the most obvious to the hidden and very hidden.</p></li></ul>",
